  stepModifiers: ['配置组合键对应的绝对步长，用于点击与上下方向键。默认 Shift 为 10；空数组关闭。未声明的修饰键按未按下匹配，首个有效规则优先，结果受最小值和最大值约束。', 'Map exact modifier chords to absolute increments for clicks and arrow keys. Shift defaults to 10; an empty array disables overrides. Unspecified modifiers must be released; the first valid match wins, within min/max.'],
  pressAndHold: ['开启加减按钮的长按连续调整。松手、取消、失焦、切换到后台、禁用或到达边界后停止。', 'Repeat while holding either step button. Stop on release, cancellation, blur, backgrounding, disabling or a boundary.'],
