  'size / sourceSize': ['图标显示画布尺寸 / 图形路径使用的源坐标尺寸。', 'Displayed canvas size and source coordinate size of the icon geometry.'],
  'icon:strokeWidth': ['单独设置图标笔触粗细，限制在 0.3–3；未设置或非有限值时沿用图标 CSS 配置，再回退到主题线宽。主体、角标和强调笔迹共用。', 'Set icon stroke weight, clamped to 0.3–3. Omitted or non-finite values inherit the icon CSS token, then the theme stroke width. Applies to the base, badge and active mark.'],
  'icon:intensity': ['颜料浓度 0–1，0 完全透明，1 保留完整笔触。默认沿用 CSS 配置或 1；越界值限制到范围内，非有限值回退主题。', 'Pigment intensity from 0 to 1: transparent at 0, full texture at 1. Inherits the CSS token or defaults to 1. Out-of-range values are clamped; non-finite values fall back to the theme.'],
  'icon:breaks': ['断笔程度 0–1，默认 0.18；固定断点位置，连续扩大缺口。0 关闭刻意断笔但保留颗粒和笔压。铺色、强调和角标同步；非有限值回退主题。', 'Stroke gaps from 0 to 1, default 0.18. Fixed gap locations grow continuously; zero removes deliberate gaps, not grain or pressure variation. Applies to wash, emphasis and badges. Non-finite values fall back to the theme.'],
  '--inkra-icon-breaks': ['在主题或容器中统一配置图标断笔程度，默认 0.18；显式 breaks 属性优先，不改变文字或边框。', 'Inherit icon stroke gaps from a theme or container, default 0.18. Explicit breaks takes precedence without changing lettering or borders.'],
  'icon:breakCount': ['每条连续笔画的最大断点个数，默认 1，范围 0–12，向下取整；0 关闭断笔。实际数量由路径长度和图标显示尺寸共同决定，短线少断或不断，放大后可增加但不超过上限。独立于 breaks 的缺口程度，不受屏幕像素密度影响。', 'Maximum gaps per continuous stroke, default 1, floored and clamped to 0-12; zero disables gaps. Path length and displayed icon size determine the actual count: short strokes use fewer gaps, larger icons can use more up to the maximum. Independent of breaks and device pixel ratio.'],
  '--inkra-icon-break-count': ['统一配置图标每条连续笔画的最大断点个数，默认 1，实际数量受显示长度限制；显式 breakCount 优先，非有限值回退主题。', 'Inherit the maximum gaps per continuous icon stroke, default 1, limited by displayed length. Explicit breakCount takes precedence; non-finite values fall back to the theme.'],
  'icon:pressureVariation': ['笔压引起的粗细与沉积变化，范围 0–1，默认 0.82。0 为恒定笔压，仍保留颗粒、端点收笔和多遍笔迹；不同于整体粗细或浓度。', 'Pressure-driven width and deposit variation from 0 to 1, default 0.82. Zero uses constant pressure while retaining grain, end taper and multiple passes; distinct from overall weight and opacity.'],
  '--inkra-icon-pressure-variation': ['在主题或容器内统一配置图标笔压变化，默认 0.82；显式 pressureVariation 优先，越界值限制到 0–1，非有限值回退主题。', 'Inherit icon pressure variation from a theme or container, default 0.82. Explicit pressureVariation takes precedence; values clamp to 0-1 and non-finite values fall back to the theme.'],
  '--inkra-icon-stroke-width / --inkra-icon-intensity': ['在主题或容器内统一配置图标粗细和浓度，默认分别为 1.5 和 1；组件同名属性优先，不改变文字或其他组件的线条。', 'Configure icon weight and intensity on a theme or container, defaulting to 1.5 and 1. Explicit component props take precedence without changing lettering or other component strokes.'],
